C03: English request verbs in the language evidence (PDF1691)

In REOPEN1689 the English variant «Summarize informe.pdf.» was answered in Spanish: request_reading._EN_WORDS carried no «summarize», so a short English request whose only other token is a Spanish file name had zero evidence and fell to the Spanish default. The English list gains summarize, summarise, summary, minimize and maximize; the language decision over the 742 registry literals is unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>


